HTTP 请求，若服务器启用了目录浏览功能，将直接泄露 Web 服务的物理绝对路径。该信息有助于攻击者进一步探测文件结构和构造攻击路径。影响 HSWeb 2.0 版本，危害等级中危，CVSS 评分 5.0。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0200"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52.183","remediation":"升级 HSWeb Web Server 至 2.0 以上版本；在服务器配置中禁用目录浏览功能（关闭 Directory Browsing 选项）；限制 /cgi/ 目录的访问权限，避免直接通过 Web 访问该目录列出文件列表。如无法升级，建议在 Web 服务器前部署反向代理过滤 /cgi/ 路径请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0052.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2336","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20609","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0200","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0200.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/hsweb_location.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0200.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2336/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0078.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0077","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0199","title":"Guido Frassetto SEDUM HTTP Server 2.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"SEDUM HTTP Server 2.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送包含 `../`（点点斜杠）序列的特制 HTTP GET 请求，突破 Web 根目录限制，读取服务器上的任意文件，如 `/etc/passwd` 等敏感配置文件。该漏洞影响 SEDUM HTTP Server 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。建议升级至最新版本或部署 Web 应用防火墙进行防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0199"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52.067","remediation":"SEDUM HTTP Server 2.0 官方未发布修复该目录遍历漏洞的补丁（CERT/CC 确认无已知解决方案），且该软件已长期停止维护。建议立即迁移至活跃维护的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。若无法立即迁移，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面过滤包含 ../ 路径遍历序列的 HTTP GET 请求，并配置服务器仅监听内网接口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0064.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/651994","http://www.osvdb.org/14797","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2335","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6063","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20608","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0199.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0199","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0199.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0199.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gwgq-248p-5j84/GHSA-gwgq-248p-5j84.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d026