公告手动安装补丁。对于 S.u.S.E Linux 6.3/6.4/7.0，升级 man 软件包至厂商提供的修复版本。如无法立即升级，可通过移除 man 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/man`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98096782126481&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-028","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2327","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6059","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20604","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0193.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0193","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0193.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0193.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-028.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xgp2-f259-4rjq/GHSA-xgp2-f259-4rjq.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b8f0a534-673f-4190-ac8e-fd162d12d62c.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2008/debian/deb_028.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0193.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0073","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0192","title":"XMail CTRLServer 缓冲区溢出任意命令执行漏洞","description":"XMail 是一款开源邮件服务器软件，其 0.5 和 0.6 版本的 CTRLServer 组件中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向 cfgfileget 或 domaindel 函数发送特制请求触发溢出，从而在目标服务器上以服务进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS v2.0 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0192"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:51.137","remediation":"升级 XMail 至 0.7 及以上版本，禁用 CTRLServer 组件的 cfgfileget 和 domaindel 功能接口，并在防火墙层面限制仅受信 IP 可访问 XMail 控制端口（默认 6017）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0047.html","http://xmailserver.org/XMail-Readme.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20622","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0192","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0192.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3mf4-86mx-6m36/GHSA-3mf4-86mx-6m36.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88434/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0192.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/abec3a381897a18ed22de6ba269987ed33e9fbb8/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0067","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0173","title":"The user wants me to generate a `title` field for CVE-2001-0173. Based on the skill's format requirement: \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型（中文）\". From the known info: - Vendor: qDecoder (the library) - Product: qDecoder library - Vulnerability type: Remote Buffer Overflow (remote code execution) So the title should be something like \"qDecoder qDecoder 库远程缓冲区溢出漏洞\" or cleaner. Looking at the example: \"Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 远程代码执行漏洞\" - the format is Vendor Product VulnerabilityType. For this case: - Vendor/Product: qDecoder - Product: qDecoder library (or just qDecoder) - Vulnerability: 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞 A cleaner title would be: \"qDecoder qDecoder 库远程缓冲区溢出漏洞\" Actually, let me think about this more carefully. The vendor is \"qDecoder\" and the product is \"qDecoder library\". In Chinese vulnerability titles, we typically see something like: \"qDecoder 库远程缓冲区溢出漏洞\" Or more precisely: \"qDecoder qDecoder库远程缓冲区溢出漏洞\" Actually, looking at the AVD description: \"qDecoder 4.x/5.x - 远程缓冲区溢出\" I think a good title would be: \"qDecoder qDecoder 库远程缓冲区溢出漏洞\" Hmm, but \"qDecoder qDecoder\" is redundant. Let me look at the example again: \"Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 远程代码执行漏洞\" - Microsoft is the vendor","description":"qDecoder 库 5.08 及更早版本存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞在处理 CGI 程序（如 CrazyWWWBoard、CrazySearch 等）接收的 HTTP 请求时，未对 MIME Content-Type 头部长度进行正确边界检查，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的超长 Content-Type 头部触发缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意命令，完全控制目标服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0173"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48.583","remediation":"立即升级 qDecoder 库至 5.08 以上版本（如存在），或停止使用基于 qDecoder 开发的 CGI 程序（CrazyWWWBoard、CrazySearch 等），迁移至现代 Web 框架替代方案。建议在 Web 服务器层面对 MIME Content-Type 头长度进行限制（如 Apache 的 LimitRequestLine 指令），并禁用对不可信 CGI 程序的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0486.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2329","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6033","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20606","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0173.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0173","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0173.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0173.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3j83-v84m-h6f2/GHSA-3j83-v84m-h6f2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8232f85e765f05f3516ab979f77c403594cd4/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0173.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0067.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0067.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0065","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0171","title":"WhitSoft SlimServe HTTPd 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WhitSoft SlimServe HTTPd 1.0/1.1 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长 GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝响应（DoS），在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 SlimServe HTTPd 1.0 及 1.1 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0171"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48.327","remediation":"立即停用 WhitSoft SlimServe HTTPd 1.0/1.1 服务器软件，该软件已于 2001 年后停止维护，不存在官方补丁。建议将 Web 服务迁移至当前受支持的替代产品，如 Nginx、Apache HTTP Server 或 Caddy，并确保使用最新稳定版本。在迁移完成前，应在防火墙或网络设备上限制对 SlimServe 服务端口（默认 TCP 80）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 地址连接，以防止远程攻击者发送超长 GET 请求触发缓冲区溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0505.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2318","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6028","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20662","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0171.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0171","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0171.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0171.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cqff-92rc-j5rc/GHSA-cqff-92rc-j5rc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2318/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5