，在未经授权的情况下实现进程间权限提升。该漏洞影响多版本内核及红帽企业版系统，攻击者需触发 ptrace 系统调用的特殊序列，与 execve 系统调用竞争关键的内核资源状态，成功后即获得更高权限访问控制。该漏洞的危害等级严重，可能导致攻击者完全控制目标主机。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0317"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-03","updated":"2001-05-03","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20721","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0317.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0317","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0317.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0317.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qr7m-wxwp-4hxg/GHSA-qr7m-wxwp-4hxg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ded5ae33-2dd1-45bb-87a1-05def9b06c12.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0124","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0286","title":"Robin Twombly A1 HTTP Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Robin Twombly A1 HTTP Server 1.0a 存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制 HTTP GET 请求，即可突破 Web 根目录限制，读取服务器上任意文件，如系统配置文件或敏感数据。该漏洞源于服务器对用户请求路径过滤不严，未正确规范化包含 `../` 的路径参数。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0286"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"A1 HTTP Server 1.0a 已停止维护，无法通过官方补丁修复。建议迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx）。若无法立即替换，应配置防火墙或反向代理进行 URL 过滤，拦截包含 `../` 的请求路径，并以低权限用户运行 Web 服务以限制文件系统访问范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0457.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20657","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2001-0286"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20657"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20657"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0124.toml"}]